---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contact | KB Compressor" description="Contact KB Compressor.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Contact</h1>
    <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <p>
        Questions, bug reports, or a form/portal that needs a specific size limit added? Send
        an email to
        <a href="mailto:contact@pixtokb.com" class="text-indigo-600 underline dark:text-indigo-400">contact@pixtokb.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Since your images are never uploaded to us, we won't be able to see the photo you were
        compressing &mdash; if you're reporting an issue, it helps to describe the file type,
        target size, and roughly what went wrong.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
